es/49/labels","id":4913070,"node_id":"MDk6TWlsZXN0b25lNDkxMzA3MA==","number":49,"title":"1.2.0.CR1","description":"","creator":{"login":"gsmet","id":1279749,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyNzk3NDk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1279749?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsmet","html_url":"https://github.com/gsmet","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsmet/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsmet/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsmet/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsmet/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsmet/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsmet/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsmet/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsmet/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsmet/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":0,"closed_issues":238,"state":"closed","created_at":"2019-12-08T21:58:56Z","updated_at":"2020-08-13T09:13:44Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":"2020-01-21T10:44:50Z"},"comments":4,"created_at":"2020-01-06T19:44:01Z","updated_at":"2020-01-08T15:34:43Z","closed_at":"2020-01-08T15:34:31Z","author_association":"NONE","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"\r\nQuarkus is not handling some contents of a web.xml file properly.\r\nSpecifically the url-pattern on a servlet-mapping does not appear\r\nto get set properly in Vertx.\r\n\r\n    <servlet>\r\n        <servlet-name>javax.ws.rs.core.Application</servlet-name>\r\n    </servlet>\r\n    <servlet-mapping>\r\n        <servlet-name>javax.ws.rs.core.Application</servlet-name>\r\n        <url-pattern>/myresources/*</url-pattern>\r\n    </servlet-mapping>\r\n\r\nThe request uri passed to resteasy from Vertx is \"/myresources/hello\"\r\nbut is should be \"/hello\".\r\n\r\nThis testcase demonstrates the issue\r\nhttps://github.com/rsearls/quarkus-NoApplicationSubclassTest\r\n\r\n--\r\nIn order to run the test you need to install this archive in your local repo\r\n\r\nmvn install:install-file \\\r\n   -Dfile=___FIX_THIS___/lib/utils-arquillian-utils-4.5.0-SNAPSHOT.jar \\\r\n   -DgroupId=org.jboss.resteasy \\\r\n   -DartifactId=utils-arquillian-utils \\\r\n   -Dversion=4.5.0-SNAPSHOT \\\r\n   -Dpackaging=jar \r\n\r\n---\r\nSet a breakpoint at following to see the issue\r\n  RootClassNode line 67   ;; here you will see the resource path \"/hello\" is\r\n                          ;; being registered\r\n\r\n  SynchronousDispatcher line 323  ;; here you will see request is of type\r\n                          ;; VertexHttpRequest.  In this obj the value of\r\n                          ;; uri.path is \"/myresources/hello\" but it should be\r\n                          ;; \"/hello\"\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n**To Reproduce**\r\nSteps to reproduce the behavior:\r\n1. \r\n2. \r\n3. \r\n\r\n**Configuration**\r\n```properties\r\n# Add your application.properties here, if applicable.\r\n\r\n```\r\n\r\n**Screenshots**\r\n(If applicable, add screenshots to help explain your problem.)\r\n\r\n**Environment (please complete the following information):**\r\n - Output of `uname -a` or `ver`: \r\n - Output of `java -version`: \r\n - GraalVM version (if different from Java): \r\n - Quarkus version or git rev: \r\n\r\n**Additional context**\r\n(Add any other context about the problem here.)\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"gsmet","id":1279749,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyNzk3NDk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1279749?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsmet","html_url":"https://github.com/gsmet","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gsmet/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/use